pi-todotools

This package extracts the former senpi-mono builtin todotools extension into
a standalone pi-coding-agent extension repository.

The extension targets the public pi-coding-agent extension API.

---

The phased, op-based todo tool (state model, operations, prompt anatomy,
markdown round trip, and phase-tree rendering) is ported and adapted from
oh-my-pi (https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi), specifically
`packages/coding-agent/src/tools/todo.ts` and
`packages/coding-agent/src/prompts/tools/todo.md` at commit
9fd6e97113f5ed3a847e66d346970efdf8afcad9 (v17.0.5), used under the MIT
